//// set: ir-e1 — 枚举 / Boolean 维上的迭代（隐式与显式范围）：1.25.0 的打印形态（ymc 未做，全 SKIP）
//// model: E10
model E10
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three); Real y[E];
equation
  for i loop y[i] = a; end for;
end E10;
//// model: E11
model E11
  Real a = time;
  Real x[3] = {a, 2 * a, 3 * a};
  Real m[2, 3] = {{a, a, a}, {a, a, a}};
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three); Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E loop y[i] = a; end for;
end E11;
//// model: E12
model E12
